#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:8
msgid "audio-playback interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `audio-playback` interface allows a snap to play sounds and music, via "
"the supporting audio service running on the system, such as PulseAudio. It's "
"used by many applications and utilities, and as such, is enabled by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"Audio recording is enabled with the companion {ref}`audio-record <interfaces-"
"audio-record-interface>` interface, and unlike `audio-playback`, is not "
"enabled (auto-connected) by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:14
msgid "<h2 id='heading--example'>Example</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"The [VLC snap](https://snapcraft.io/vlc) is a good example of an application "
"using the  audio-playback interface:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:19
msgid ""
"$ snap connections vlc\n"
"Interface               Plug                        Slot                     "
"Notes\n"
"audio-playback          vlc:audio-playback          :audio-playback          "
"-\n"
"audio-record            vlc:audio-record            -                        "
"-\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:26
msgid ""
"If for some reason you want to disable audio playback for a snap, use the "
"disconnect command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:28
msgid "snap disconnect vlc:audio-playback\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:32
msgid "The connect command can be used to re-enable audio playback:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:34
msgid "snap connect vlc:audio-playback\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:39
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:41
msgid "**Auto-connect**: yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:44
msgid ""
"The `audio-playback` slot is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`. The slot owns a unique system-"
"wide resource that instances would conflict over."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:47
msgid "<h3 id='heading-code'>Code examples</h3>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:49
msgid ""
"The snapcraft.yaml for [VLC](https://github.com/videolan/vlc) includes audio-"
"playback configuration: [https://github.com/videolan/vlc/blob/master/extras/"
"package/snap/snapcraft.yaml](https://github.com/videolan/vlc/blob/"
"75bca603749d8bfb7048a84ea811cbdb19447596/extras/package/snap/"
"snapcraft.yaml#L36)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-playback-interface.md:52
msgid ""
"The source code for this interface is in the *snapd* repository: <https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/audio_playback.go>"
msgstr ""
